<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean firms seek 35,000T of oilseed meal.</title>
<headline>S.Korean firms seek 35,000T of oilseed meal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean firms on Friday jointly invited tenders for 12,000 tonnes of cottonseed meal, 12,500 tonnes of wheatbran pellet, 10,500 tonnes of rapeseed meal by 3:00 p.m. (0600 GMT), traders said.</p>
</text>
